@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2
skinparam roundcorner 10
skinparam maxmessagesize 60

actor Penulis as User
boundary HalamanEditorUI as EditorUI
control ArtikelController as Controller

== Main Flow ==

User -> EditorUI : 1: Klik tombol Publikasikan di editor
activate EditorUI
EditorUI -> Controller : 1.1: publikasikanArtikel(artikelId)
activate Controller
Controller -> Controller : 1.1.1: validasiArtikel()

alt [Validasi berhasil]
    Controller --> EditorUI : 1.1.2: Validasi berhasil
    EditorUI --> User : 1.1.3: Notifikasi sukses publikasi
    EditorUI -> EditorUI : 1.1.4: Redirect ke halaman detail artikel
else [Validasi gagal]
    Controller --> EditorUI : 1.1.2a: Error validasi
    EditorUI --> User : 1.1.3a: Pesan error
end

deactivate Controller
deactivate EditorUI

@enduml
